{"type":"record","name":"CvdLevelsSnapshot","namespace":"com.optionsedge.contracts.cvd","doc":"Canonical CVD Avro migration contract. Counts use exact integer units. Prices use decimal(38,18), exact conversion with no rounding. The Kafka key and trading semantics are unchanged. Avro-only new writes; explicit compatible readers also accept retained JSON during same-topic roll-forward.","fields":[{"name":"schemaVersion","type":"string"},{"name":"symbol","type":"string"},{"name":"state","type":"string"},{"name":"sessionDate","type":"string"},{"name":"observable","type":"boolean"},{"name":"sessionComplete","type":"boolean"},{"name":"engineSessionCvd","type":"long"},{"name":"foldPositionMs","type":"long"},{"name":"foldPrints","type":"long"},{"name":"flowEventTimeMs","type":"long"},{"name":"flip","type":["null",{"type":"record","name":"CvdFlip","fields":[{"name":"priceCents","type":"long"},{"name":"atMs","type":"long"},{"name":"direction","type":"string"},{"name":"cvdAtCross","type":"long"}]}],"default":null},{"name":"buyLevels","type":["null",{"type":"array","items":{"type":"record","name":"CvdPriceLevel","fields":[{"name":"priceCents","type":"long"},{"name":"deltaSum","type":"long"},{"name":"tradeCount","type":"long"},{"name":"lastTouchMs","type":"long"}]}}],"default":null},{"name":"sellLevels","type":["null",{"type":"array","items":"CvdPriceLevel"}],"default":null},{"name":"balancePriceCents","type":["null","long"],"default":null},{"name":"publishedAtMs","type":"long"},{"name":"_present","type":{"type":"array","items":"int"},"default":[]}],"optionsedge.api-presence-field":"_present"}